GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/register

### health

GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/health

### time-consuming

GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/time-consuming

### valid register

POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=test&password=test&email=test@test.com

### invalid password

POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=test&password=test123

### invalid username

POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=test123&password=test

### valid login

POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=test&password=test

### home (article list)

GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/

### article detail

GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/post/1

### new article form (login required)

GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/post/new

### create article (login required)

POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/post
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Hello&content=First+post+body

### create comment (login required)

POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/post/1/comment
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

content=Nice+post

### logout

POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/logout

### admin dashboard (admin role required)

GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/admin

### approve comment (admin only)

POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/admin/comments/1/approve

### delete comment (admin only)

POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/admin/comments/1/delete

### delete article (admin only)

POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/admin/articles/1/delete